-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations              108   ->   54          
Number of variables                   3   ->   3           
j variable (2 values)              year   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                                   u_fe   ->   u_fe1987 u_fe1988
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

. 
. correlate u_fe1987 u_fe1988, cov
(obs=54)

